# Agent Operating Rules

This project strictly adheres to the standards defined in the root [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Key Directives:
1. Always run `./scripts/verify.ps1` (or `./scripts/verify.sh`) before marking any task as complete.
2. Read `specs/active/` before implementing complex features.
3. Review `docs/adr/` before introducing new dependencies or patterns.
4. Follow conventional commit format (`feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `test:`).
5. For PR reviews, follow the evaluation rules in `.agents/pr-reviewer.md`.
